  "intro": "A thin woman in a cloak sewn with thorns has her palm on a birch, and the birch is dying: its leaves curl and fall as you watch, and the woman looks younger with every leaf. She sees you. She doesn't stop. \"Siphon,\" she says. \"They'd never teach it to you up there.\"",
